#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:3
#: 1e54823113ae4d528dd424ae48906dde
msgid "Logfiles"
msgstr "日志文件"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:5
#: d10bd7d937ba4ad3becf89dc577888ac
msgid ""
"When connected to a vehicle, MAVProxy will automatically save any received "
"telemetry to a logfile."
msgstr "连接到飞行器后，MAVProxy 将自动将所有接收到的数传数据保存到日志文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:7
#: 37de2be674b34f2687ed187303067ea0
msgid "This logfile can be used for post-flight analysis or flight replay."
msgstr "该日志文件可用于飞后分析或飞行回放。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:9
#: 785c7117fa7e49669550107d5f24126f
msgid ""
"By default, the logfile will be saved as ``mav.tlog`` and ``mav.tlog.raw`` "
"in the same folder that MAVProxy was executed from. For example:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，日志文件将以 ``mav.tlog`` 和 ``mav.tlog.raw`` 的形式保存在 MAVProxy 执行时所在的文件夹中。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:15
#: 65c1f8de52004e0998230d3a3134fa8b
msgid ""
"Will log the telemetry to ``mav.tlog`` and ``mav.tlog.raw`` in the "
"``~/Documents/code/MAVProxy`` folder."
msgstr ""
"将把数传记录到 ``~/Documents/code/MAVProxy`` 文件夹下的 ``mav.tlog`` 和 ``mav.tlog.raw`` "
"文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:17
#: c9ac424d45be48bfaf0ca30f2cff1164
msgid "In the example:"
msgstr "在以下示例中："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:23
#: 99eaf74487fe47cbb1b852956144cd90
msgid ""
"Will log the telemetry to ``mav.tlog`` and ``mav.tlog.raw`` in the "
"``C:\\users\\stephen\\Documents\\logs`` folder."
msgstr ""
"将把数传记录到 ``C:\\users\\stephen\\Documents\\logs`` 文件夹下的 ``mav.tlog`` 和 "
"``mav.tlog.raw`` 文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:25
#: f6084a35011d45e7972d19926006b768
msgid ""
"Note that both the ``mav.tlog`` and the ``mav.tlog.raw`` files contain the "
"same data (albeit in different formats). In most cases however the raw file "
"is not used by the analysis or replay tools."
msgstr ""
"请注意，``mav.tlog`` 和 ``mav.tlog.raw`` 文件包含相同的数据（尽管格式不同）。然而在大多数情况下，raw "
"文件不会被分析或回放工具使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:27
#: 14c2c856f0ea474bbcfb3a7435d48db7
msgid ""
"MAVProxy can use the ``--aircraft=name`` (see :ref:`here <mavproxy-"
"starting>`) argument to place the logfile in a specific name and date "
"folder. This is useful for keeping logfiles sorted. See starting for further"
" details."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 可使用 ``--aircraft=name`` （参见 :ref:`此处 <mavproxy-"
"starting>`）参数将日志文件存放到以特定名称和日期命名的文件夹中。这有助于对日志文件进行分类管理。详细信息请参阅启动选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:29
#: 73c7d5df380e47cda3aadf78f79a1a90
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:35
#: ee44e688c6a44519810cba99c077c092
msgid ""
"Will log the telemetry to ``flight.tlog`` and ``flight.tlog.raw`` in the "
"``C:\\users\\stephen\\Documents\\Logs\\Copter\\<date>\\flight<n>\\`` folder."
msgstr ""
"将把数传记录到 ``C:\\users\\stephen\\Documents\\Logs\\Copter\\<date>\\flight<n>\\``"
" 文件夹下的 ``flight.tlog`` 和 ``flight.tlog.raw`` 文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:37
#: 6f6920e42b6445ac9f8d928dfb0b46ec
msgid ""
"The ``--mission=name`` (see :ref:`here <mavproxy-starting>`) startup "
"argument can be used with the ``--aircraft=name`` argument to use a specific"
" name for the flight, rather than <date>. For example:"
msgstr ""
"``--mission=name`` （参见 :ref:`此处 <mavproxy-starting>`）启动参数可与 "
"``--aircraft=name`` 参数一起使用，以为飞行指定特定名称，而非使用默认的 <date>。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:43
#: af93fc981c294742b09085d78b892839
msgid ""
"Will log the telemetry to ``flight.tlog`` and ``flight.tlog.raw`` in the "
"``C:\\users\\stephen\\Documents\\Logs\\Copter\\flyby\\flight<n>\\`` folder."
msgstr ""
"将把数传记录到 ``C:\\users\\stephen\\Documents\\Logs\\Copter\\flyby\\flight<n>\\`` "
"文件夹下的 ``flight.tlog`` 和 ``flight.tlog.raw`` 文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:45
#: 0fa43bd1dd44437390d7cf5598cd8263
msgid ""
"The ``--state-basedir=dir`` argument can be used to specify the base "
"directory of where the telemetry files will be stored."
msgstr "``--state-basedir=dir`` 参数可用于指定数传文件存储的基础目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:51
#: 67585a08bd33413a82598f200bf328cb
msgid "Will store the log files in ``C:\\logs\\copter\\flyby\\flight<n>\\`` folder."
msgstr "将把日志文件存储在 ``C:\\logs\\copter\\flyby\\flight<n>\\`` 文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/logfiles.rst:53
#: 8596a111d3474e438e30627803f16721
msgid ""
"The MAVExplorer program can be used to view graphs and track of the flight "
"data stored in these files."
msgstr "可使用 MAVExplorer 程序查看存储在这些文件中的飞行数据的图表和轨迹。"
